'''Baki Hanma''' (範馬刃牙, ''Hanma Baki'', '''Baki Hanma''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Baki Hanma
|image = E 724.png
|first appearance = [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,500¢ - 17,775¢
}}

==Enemy==
Baki Hanma is a powerful pusher that can reach up to 450 range, enough to hit many backliners like [[Crazed Bahamut Cat]], while his reduced standing range allows him to pierce through defense and advance more deeply with ease. Combining his Omni Strike with a fast attack rate, he's able to constantly juggle units with slower attacks and push forward with even more ease, with a cherry on top as a 5% chance to land a Critical Hit and double his effective damage. Baki also has an Immunity to Slow and Explosions, which counters both [[Cyberpunk Cat]] and Talented [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]], making him extremely dangerous on stages like the Arena of Honor.

==Strategy==
Since Baki will constantly juggle units, the best way to counter him is to use fast rushers with a low foreswing like [[Bullet Train Cat]] or [[Courier Cat]], or use tankers with Knockback Immunity.

